				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2d8ef077-8ee8-41a5-84ed-97d76409d2e6")
	)
	(text "Mode set via R20 and R19\nFor efficiency and thermal performance, switching frequency is set to\nits minimum value (400 kHz) and light load operation is set to DCM instead of FCCM.\nOutput current limit is set to ILIM(9.4 A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.69 140.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "4117d8f2-8786-4b10-a4e3-daa3caffe4f7")
	)
	(text "Inductor is set as Würth 744325330, as recommended in the datasheet\nfor 5.5V output 400 kHz(closest match case)\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.086 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "55597d3e-8a43-4900-8a4b-a94266bff72f")
	)
	(text "88-100uF output capacitance recommended\n"
